// GlowInTheDark 2.0 -- menus.
//
// Unlike 1.1, nothing here needs a map restart. Lane changes re-apply within
// about a fifth of a second; the wave and surface-detail pages take effect on
// the next tic.

// menu_lint (tools\menu_lint.py) holds every page with a slider to the
// live-slider rule: each slider has to move the glow while the menu is open.
// Here that is two UiTick paths -- PushGlobals for the wave, surface detail
// and speeds, and the lane apply for the lanes, liquids and randomiser. See
// the LINT-UI-LIVE lines beside PushGlobals and BeginApply in gitd_handler.zs.
// LINT-LIVE: GITDMain GITDLaneWF GITDLaneWC GITDLaneFG GITDLaneCG GITDLiquid GITDRandom GITDWave GITDDetail

